// ============================================================================
// Done: Pivot Confirmation Diagnostics (showDiagnostics), the simultaneous
// high/low tie-break, pivot-bar ATR semantics, the shared label object
// budget, the Lower-Timeframe Engine, the Recursive (Level 2) ZigZag, and
// Dual ZigZag (Secondary) — see CHANGELOG. No open TODOs remain; further
// work here would be new feature requests rather than backlog items.
